<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<title>Ad Cards | <%= siteTitle ? siteTitle + ' ' : '' %>Admin</title>
</head>
<body data-page="ad-cards">
<div class="admin-shell">
  <%- include('../partials/nav', { activePage: 'ad-cards' }) %>
  <main class="admin-main">
    <section class="admin-page-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="admin-eyebrow">Content</p>
        <h1>Ad Cards</h1>
        <p>Design your own cards for the promotion campaigns, including cards with a looping demo above the text. The media is never uploaded here: you paste a link to a file hosted somewhere else, and the visitor's browser loads it directly from there.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="admin-callout">
      Each campaign chooses what it shows (automatic cards, ad cards or both) on the Promotion page. An ad card shows in a campaign only while it is on, today is inside its dates, and it is assigned to that campaign. A change reaches websites within about 15 minutes.
    </div>

    <section class="admin-split-grid">
      <div class="admin-card admin-sticky-card">
        <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow" id="adFormEyebrow">Create</p><h2 id="adFormHeading">Add ad card</h2></div></div>
        <form id="adForm">
          <label class="admin-label" for="adName">Name</label>
          <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="name" id="adName" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" placeholder="So you can recognise it">

          <label class="admin-label" for="adLayout">Layout</label>
          <select class="admin-select" name="layout" id="adLayout">
            <option value="text">Text card</option>
            <option value="media">Card with media</option>
            <option value="banner">Media only banner</option>
          </select>
          <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1" id="adLayoutHint"></p>

          <div id="adMediaSection" style="display:none;">
            <label class="admin-label" for="adMediaUrl">Media link</label>
            <input class="admin-input font-mono" type="url" name="mediaUrl" id="adMediaUrl" maxlength="2000" autocomplete="off" placeholder="https://">
            <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1">Must be a direct link to the file itself, ending in a file type such as gif or mp4, not a link to a web page that shows the file. It must start with https. Visitors' browsers load the file straight from that link's host, so the host sees the visit.</p>

            <div class="admin-form-grid-2">
              <div>
                <label class="admin-label" for="adMediaKind">Kind</label>
                <select class="admin-select" name="mediaKind" id="adMediaKind">
                  <option value="image">Image or GIF</option>
                  <option value="video">Video</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="admin-label" for="adMediaFit">Fit</label>
                <select class="admin-select" name="mediaFit" id="adMediaFit">
                  <option value="fill">Fill the area</option>
                  <option value="fit">Fit inside it</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label class="admin-label" for="adRatioPreset">Shape (width to height)</label>
            <select class="admin-select" id="adRatioPreset">
              <option value="16:9">16:9</option>
              <option value="4:3">4:3</option>
              <option value="1:1">1:1</option>
              <option value="3:1">3:1</option>
              <option value="4:1">4:1</option>
              <option value="custom">Custom</option>
            </select>
            <div class="admin-form-grid-2" id="adRatioCustom" style="display:none;">
              <div>
                <label class="admin-label" for="adRatioW">Width</label>
                <input class="admin-input" type="number" name="ratioW" id="adRatioW" min="1" max="100" step="1" value="16">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="admin-label" for="adRatioH">Height</label>
                <input class="admin-input" type="number" name="ratioH" id="adRatioH" min="1" max="100" step="1" value="9">
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1">The file is never downloaded to measure it, so this shape decides how much space is reserved for it.</p>

            <label class="admin-label" for="adMediaAlt">Alternative text</label>
            <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="mediaAlt" id="adMediaAlt" maxlength="125" autocomplete="off">
            <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1">Describe the media in a few words. Required.</p>

            <label class="admin-label" for="adStillUrl">Still image link <span class="font-normal text-gray-400">(optional)</span></label>
            <input class="admin-input font-mono" type="url" name="stillUrl" id="adStillUrl" maxlength="2000" autocomplete="off" placeholder="https://">
            <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1">Shown as the poster for a video, and instead of the animation for visitors with reduced motion or a data saver. Without one, those visitors get the text only and the animated file is never downloaded.</p>
          </div>

          <label class="admin-label" for="adHeadline">Headline</label>
          <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="headline" id="adHeadline" maxlength="60" autocomplete="off" required>
          <label class="admin-label" for="adLine">Supporting line <span class="font-normal text-gray-400">(optional)</span></label>
          <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="line" id="adLine" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off">
          <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1">Plain text, no links.</p>
          <label class="admin-label" for="adButton">Button label</label>
          <input class="admin-input" type="text" name="buttonLabel" id="adButton" maxlength="24" autocomplete="off" required>

          <label class="admin-label" for="adDest">Destination</label>
          <select class="admin-select" name="destTypeId" id="adDest"></select>
          <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1">Where the button sends visitors. If the chosen type is switched off or deleted, visitors go to the home page instead.</p>

          <div class="admin-form-grid-2">
            <div>
              <label class="admin-label" for="adCorner">Corners</label>
              <select class="admin-select" name="corner" id="adCorner">
                <option value="">Campaign's choice</option>
                <option value="soft">Soft</option>
                <option value="sharp">Sharp</option>
                <option value="round">Round</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="admin-label" for="adDensity">Density</label>
              <select class="admin-select" name="density" id="adDensity">
                <option value="">Campaign's choice</option>
                <option value="comfortable">Comfortable</option>
                <option value="compact">Compact</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="admin-form-grid-2">
            <div>
              <label class="admin-label" for="adAccent">Accent colour</label>
              <input class="admin-input font-mono" type="text" name="accentColor" id="adAccent" maxlength="7" autocomplete="off" placeholder="#RRGGBB">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="admin-label" for="adCardBg">Card background</label>
              <input class="admin-input font-mono" type="text" name="cardBg" id="adCardBg" maxlength="7" autocomplete="off" placeholder="#RRGGBB">
            </div>
          </div>
          <label class="admin-label" for="adTextColor">Text colour</label>
          <input class="admin-input font-mono" type="text" name="textColor" id="adTextColor" maxlength="7" autocomplete="off" placeholder="#RRGGBB">
          <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1">All of these are optional and win over the campaign's own choices. Leave one blank to use the campaign's, or the brand default.</p>
          <p id="adContrast" class="admin-msg admin-msg-warning" style="display:none;"></p>

          <div class="admin-form-grid-2">
            <div>
              <label class="admin-label" for="adStartsOn">Start date <span class="font-normal text-gray-400">(optional)</span></label>
              <input class="admin-input" type="date" name="startsOn" id="adStartsOn">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="admin-label" for="adEndsOn">End date <span class="font-normal text-gray-400">(optional)</span></label>
              <input class="admin-input" type="date" name="endsOn" id="adEndsOn">
            </div>
          </div>
          <label class="admin-label" for="adWeight">Weight (1 to 10)</label>
          <input class="admin-input" type="number" name="weight" id="adWeight" min="1" max="10" step="1" value="5">
          <p class="admin-form-hint mt-1">How often it appears compared to other ad cards. Dates are in UTC. Each automatic card counts as weight 1.</p>
          <label class="admin-checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" name="isActive" id="adActive" checked> On</label>

          <label class="admin-label">Campaigns</label>
          <label class="admin-checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" name="allCampaigns" id="adAllCampaigns" checked> All campaigns</label>
          <div id="adCampaignList" style="display:none;"></div>

          <div class="admin-form-actions">
            <button type="submit" id="adSubmitBtn" class="admin-btn">Add ad card</button>
            <button type="button" id="adCancelBtn" class="admin-btn-outline" style="display:none;">Cancel</button>
            <p id="adStatus" class="admin-msg" style="display:none;"></p>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="admin-card mb-6">
          <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Live preview</p><h2>Preview</h2></div></div>
          <div class="admin-form-actions" style="margin-top:0;">
            <button type="button" class="admin-btn admin-btn-sm" id="adPreviewLight">Light</button>
            <button type="button" class="admin-btn-outline admin-btn-sm" id="adPreviewDark">Dark</button>
          </div>
          <p id="adPreviewError" class="admin-msg admin-msg-error" style="display:none;"></p>
          <p id="adPreviewNote" class="admin-msg admin-msg-warning" style="display:none;"></p>
          <p class="admin-form-hint mt-3">Narrow (320 px)</p>
          <div id="adStageNarrow" class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-3" style="width:352px;max-width:100%;"></div>
          <p class="admin-form-hint mt-3">Wide (640 px)</p>
          <div id="adStageWide" class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-3" style="width:672px;max-width:100%;"></div>
          <p class="admin-form-hint mt-2">This is the real card, built from the form as it is now. The media loads from your link right here, so you can check it. If it does not load, you are told below the preview. Links in a preview are not counted.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="admin-list-panel">
          <div class="admin-section-heading"><div><p class="admin-eyebrow">Ad cards</p><h2>Ad cards</h2></div></div>
          <div id="adList" class="admin-entry-list"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
